    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Gun God",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "The Legend of Gunshen tells the story of Gene Lock as a mysteriously coming super-age technology, which can promote the unprecedented enhancement of human body functions in speed, strength, and senses. Those who successfully open the gene lock become the \"agents\" of the new era, and the best of them are called the \"gun gods\". Regarding the new armament of gene lock, various forces have fought fiercely and established academies to cultivate special agents. With the breakthrough and application of experiments, and the coercion from mysterious races, the world gradually plunged into the quagmire of war... After the war ended, the mysterious races disappeared, and the agents and gun gods became unproven urban legends. The two major spy organizations of \"Deep Sea\" and \"Wild Snake\" moved their bases to the seabed and underground respectively, without disturbing each other. However, under the scene of peace, there are real dangers.",
        "jpn": null
    },
    "Aliases": [
        "Age of Gunslingers"
    ],
